    <!-- Tips: short, precise, kind, occasionally dry -->
    <string name="advice_tip_see_bright_light">Outside is best. A window seat counts.</string>
    <string name="advice_tip_see_light">Daylight or a bright room. Don\'t hide in the dark.</string>
    <string name="advice_tip_avoid_light">Sunglasses on, even if it feels silly. Especially if it feels silly.</string>
    <string name="advice_tip_sleep">Dark, cool, screens away.</string>
    <string name="advice_tip_nap">Keep it short. Set an alarm.</string>
    <string name="advice_tip_optional_nap">Only if you need it. Short beats long.</string>
    <string name="advice_tip_melatonin">As planned, then keep the lights low.</string>
    <string name="advice_tip_caffeine">A small coffee helps now. Little and often.</string>
    <string name="advice_tip_avoid_caffeine">Coffee now would cost you sleep later.</string>
    <string name="advice_tip_peak_fatigue">Your body clock is at its low. Take care, especially driving.</string>
    <string name="advice_tip_flight">Settle in. The plan knows you\'re in the air.</string>

